 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Infinitive with and without «å»",
     "texto": [
      "After **kan**, **vil** and **må** the infinitive is used without **å**: **Jeg kan jobbe** («I can work»). After **ønsker**, **prøver** and **håper**, you use **å**: **Jeg ønsker å bidra** («I want to contribute»). **For å + infinitivo** expresses purpose."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Presenting yourself in an application",
     "texto": [
      "**Motivasjon** is the reason or interest that makes you apply for the post. An effective application links your experience with the advertised tasks and uses concrete examples."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
